<item name='$Comment'><text>Hidden keyword lookup view. NOTE: the Awards column formulas are evaluated against the multi-valued Profile.Awards item, so @DbLookup callers receive lists; older Keyword documents (one per value) still exist from the 2004 design and duplicate the Profile entries.</text></item>
